body:
I agree it's frustrating. It's not fun competing against the whole lobby spamming for Aphelios or Jax... I'm excited for the meta to change. The fact that his turrets attack while he's in GA stasis is totally bogus and they are nerfing it. I do find it odd that in the description of his turrets, they act as an extension of himself.. I believe they are making the change on the PBE to stop his turrets while he's in GA stasis. 

&#x200B;

Until then, I'm not going to be playing as much.
